# Feature: QA/Review Rollback Failure Semantics and Impl-Response Artifact Conformance

## Description
Loop 1 completed backend-timeout conformance and foundational E2E mock helpers. The next missing, high-impact scope is rollback failure semantics and review-feedback artifact coverage: tighten QA/review rollback tests to enforce failed terminal state behavior, and add the missing `impl-response` artifact conformance test for review feedback iterations.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Rename and harden rollback tests to explicit failure semantics (`qa::iteration_limit_fails`, `run::review_limit_fails`) while keeping their current rollback setup paths.
- [ ] QA and review rollback tests both run with `--loops 1`, force failure independently, and assert: non-zero exit, `state.json` project `status` is `failed`, `loops` is empty, and rolled-back loop directory is absent.
- [ ] Rollback tests also assert no loop git tag remains for the rolled-back loop.
- [ ] Runtime error handling marks project state `failed` when orchestration exits due to QA/review iteration-limit errors (matching existing timeout-failure handling).
- [ ] Add `impl_response_artifact_on_review_feedback` conformance test that triggers one review feedback cycle before approval.
- [ ] The new impl-response test asserts exactly one `*-impl-response-001.md` artifact exists and its YAML frontmatter includes `artifact`, `iteration`, and `role`.
- [ ] The impl-response artifact body assertion verifies expected implementer response content for the feedback iteration.

## Files to Modify/Create
- `src/validate/tests_qa.rs` - Rename/update QA rollback test to assert failed terminal state and stricter rollback outcomes.
- `src/validate/tests_run.rs` - Rename/update review rollback test; add `impl_response_artifact_on_review_feedback`.
- `src/validate/mock_scripts.rs` - Add deterministic mock behavior for “review feedback once, then approve” flow.
- `src/cli/run.rs` - Extend project-failure marking to include QA/review iteration-limit terminal errors.
- `src/validate/assertions.rs` - Add small helper(s) if needed for single-artifact suffix matching and loop-path absence checks.

## Dependencies
- Requires: Backend Timeout Conformance and Mock Script Foundations
- Blocks: Reformatter fallback boundary conformance, PR metadata verification, `docs/validate-e2e.md` final documentation mapping

