Loop 1 completed backend-timeout conformance and foundational E2E mock helpers. The next missing, high-impact scope is rollback failure semantics and review-feedback artifact coverage: tighten QA/review rollback tests to enforce failed terminal state behavior, and add the missing `impl-response` artifact conformance test for review feedback iterations.

